reports/schedule_adapter/
reports/odds_control_plane/odds_history/
reports/refresh_status/latest/hot_artifact_pull_watermark.json

# Test-run pollution: #72 already removed the production prediction-ledger
# write path, so any growth here is local pytest runs, not real usage
# (measured: ~14.5KB per test, quadratic -- see tests/conftest.py). The NHL/
# MLB/soccer odds-lifecycle tests independently leak into the real repo's
# data/odds_events/<date>.jsonl the same way; both got swept into 0250ac82
# by accident.
data/prediction_ledger.json
data/odds_events/

# tests/test_mlb_refresh_runner.py's live-lens tests mock live_lens_report_path
# to a bare relative "report.json" instead of a tmp path; repeatedly leaked
# fixture output into this repo-root file across several sessions (66720d0b,
# 42472a9f, 71b57a82, ...) and got committed by accident each time.
/report.json